  "guide_open_food_facts_what_is_open_food_facts_title": "什么是 Open Food Facts？",
  "guide_open_food_facts_what_is_open_food_facts_paragraph1": "Open Food Facts 是一个来自世界各地的食品的**协作**、**免费**、**开放**数据库。",
