  "guide_open_pet_food_facts_what_is_open_pet_food_facts_title": "什么是 Open Pet Food Facts？",
  "guide_open_pet_food_facts_what_is_open_pet_food_facts_paragraph1": "Open Pet Food Facts 将我们的使命延伸到我们毛茸茸的朋友身上！它是**猫、狗及其他同伴宠物的食品数据库**。",
  "@guide_open_pet_food_facts_what_is_open_pet_food_facts_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_pet_food_facts_what_is_open_pet_food_facts_paragraph2": "我们收集有关**成分**、**营养分析**和喂养指南的信息，以帮助宠物主人选择最适合其动物需求的食物。",
  "@guide_open_pet_food_facts_what_is_open_pet_food_facts_paragraph2": {
