  "guide_open_beauty_facts_what_is_open_beauty_facts_title": "什么是 Open Beauty Facts？",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_what_is_open_beauty_facts_paragraph1": "Open Beauty Facts 是一个**化妆品**的协作数据库。",
  "@guide_open_beauty_facts_what_is_open_beauty_facts_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_what_is_open_beauty_facts_paragraph2": "Our goal is to decipher ingredient lists to help you **understand what's in your personal care items**. From moisturizers to makeup, we collect data on ingredients, allergens, and packaging to promote transparency in the cosmetics industry.",
  "@guide_open_beauty_facts_what_is_open_beauty_facts_paragraph2": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_features_title": "Open Beauty Facts 的特点",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_features_arg1_title": "获取您的不受欢迎成分警报",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_features_arg1_paragraph1": "您对任何成分过敏吗？想避免致粉刺物质吗？想远离有争议的成分吗？您可以直接在应用程序中设置要避免的化妆品成分列表！",
