  "guide_open_beauty_facts_tips_arg1_title": "不要做的",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_tips_arg1_text1": "避免阴影和眩光。",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_tips_arg1_text2": "没有模糊或失焦的文字。",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_tips_arg1_text3": "不要裁剪部分文字。",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_tips_arg1_text4": "避免杂乱的背景。",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_tips_arg2_title": "要做的",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_tips_arg2_text1": "使用良好且均匀的照明。",
  "guide_open_beauty_facts_tips_arg2_text2": "确保文字清晰易读。",
