  "guide_open_prices_title": "欢迎来到 Open Prices！",
  "@guide_open_prices_title": {
    "description": "The title of the guide (please don't forget the use of non-breaking spaces)"
  },
  "guide_open_prices_what_is_open_prices_title": "什么是 Open Prices？",
  "guide_open_prices_what_is_open_prices_paragraph1": "Open Prices 是一个旨在**收集和分享全球产品价格**的项目。这是一个可公开访问的数据集，可用于研究、分析等。Open Prices 由 Open Food Facts 开发和维护。",
  "@guide_open_prices_what_is_open_prices_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_prices_what_is_open_prices_paragraph2": "There are currently few companies that own large databases of product prices at the barcode level. These prices are not freely available, but sold at a high price to private actors, researchers and other organizations that can afford them.",
  "@guide_open_prices_what_is_open_prices_paragraph2": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_prices_how_title": "Open Prices 是如何工作的？",
  "guide_open_prices_how_paragraph1": "**我们正在众包一个开源的价格数据集**。用户可以通过此 Web 应用程序，或通过官方 Open Food Facts 移动应用程序添加价格。零售商或第三方应用程序也可以通过使用我们的 API 进行贡献。",
  "guide_open_prices_how_arg1_title": "收集过道上价格标签的照片",
  "guide_open_prices_how_arg2_title": "收集收据照片",
  "guide_open_prices_why_title": "为什么 Open Food Facts 要这样做？",
  "guide_open_prices_why_paragraph1": "价格信息对于理解食品系统至关重要。这是了解食品成本和促进更健康饮食的关键因素。开放价格数据是一种方式，使研究人员、记者和公民更容易**更好地了解食品价格在地理和时间上的变化**。",
  "guide_open_prices_why_arg1_title": "跟踪价格随时间的演变",
  "guide_open_prices_why_arg1_text": "看到**价格的演变**：缩水式通货膨胀，廉价式通货膨胀，我们可以一起跟踪它们！",
  "guide_open_prices_why_arg2_title": "比较您附近的价格",
  "guide_open_prices_why_arg2_text": "随着我们获得更多价格，您可以找到**您周围最便宜的商店**。",
  "guide_open_prices_scrapping_title": "您是否考虑过从零售商的网站上抓取价格？",
  "guide_open_prices_scrapping_paragraph1": "出于法律和技术原因，**我们不认为从零售商网站抓取价格是向 Open Prices 贡献的有效方式**。我们想确保我们收集的价格准确且最新，而从贡献者那里收到抓取的价格不允许我们这样做。",
  "guide_open_prices_scrapping_paragraph2": "价格抓取是未来版 Open Prices 中考虑的一个选项，但将由 Open Prices 本身完成，这样我们就可以基于 HTML 页面提供价格证明。",
  "guide_open_prices_retailers_title": "我是一名零售商，我想贡献价格。我该怎么做？",
  "guide_open_prices_retailers_paragraph1": "您可以使用我们的 API 贡献价格。\n如果您想大规模贡献价格，请通过 prices@openfoodfacts.org 与我们取得联系。",
  "guide_open_prices_share_link": "https://prices.openfoodfacts.org/about",
  "guide_open_products_facts_title": "欢迎来到 Open Products Facts！",
  "@guide_open_products_facts_title": {
    "description": "The title of the guide (please don't forget the use of non-breaking spaces)"
  },
  "guide_open_products_facts_what_is_open_products_facts_title": "什么是 Open Products Facts？",
  "guide_open_products_facts_what_is_open_products_facts_paragraph1": "Open Products Facts 是一个面向**任何带条形码但不是食品、化妆品或宠物食品的产品**的庞大开放数据库。",
  "@guide_open_products_facts_what_is_open_products_facts_paragraph1": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_products_facts_what_is_open_products_facts_paragraph2": "从**电子产品**到**玩具**，从**衣服**到**清洁用品**，只要有条形码，都可以添加。这个项目旨在为日常物品创建一个“物联网”，让它们的信息被普遍访问。",
  "@guide_open_products_facts_what_is_open_products_facts_paragraph2": {
    "description": "Text between asterisks (eg: **My Text**) means text in bold. Please try to keep it."
  },
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_title": "Open Products Facts 的特点",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_text": "Open Products Facts 旨在通过提供循环解决方案以供维护、**修理**、**回收**其物品或为它们寻找新主人，帮助消费者**延长物品寿命**。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg1_title": "某些产品的碳足迹",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg1_text": "**Impact CO2** by French Environment Authority ADEME provides the **carbon impact** of many categories, make sure to categorize products precisely.",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg2_title": "许多产品的可修度指数",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg2_text": "只要有法国的可修度指数可用，我们就会显示它。此外，**您可以使用大众分类引擎 (Folksonomy Engine) 开始收集变量**；这样即使在它不可用的国家，我们未来也可以自行重新计算。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg3_title": "寻找捐赠/转售产品的方式",
  "guide_open_products_facts_features_arg3_text": "我们提供**第三方循环友好服务**的链接，帮助您获得想要的二手产品，对地球资源更温和。\n请注意，我们并没有为此获得报酬，并且该系统目前仅作为法国两个网站的示例运行。您可以帮助扩展该系统，在 Wiki 上记录更多网站。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_information_title": "什么信息是有用的？",
  "guide_open_products_facts_information_text": "对于如此广泛的物品，**我们收集的数据是灵活的**。为了做到这一点，**我们创建了大众分类引擎 (Folksonomy Engine)**。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_folksonomy_title": "大众分类引擎 (Folksonomy Engine)",
  "guide_open_products_facts_folksonomy_paragraph1": "大众分类引擎是一个帮助您用相关属性完善产品的工具。这有助于改善搜索和可发现性，但也能在未来计算和展示有趣的内容。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_folksonomy_paragraph2": "您可以添加任何键和值，如：**compatibility_with_5G_mobile_network: yes**",
  "guide_open_products_facts_folksonomy_paragraph3": "您将获得可能属性的自动建议，非常欢迎在您喜欢的商品上添加并记录新的属性。",
  "guide_open_products_facts_share_link": "https://world-zh.openproductsfacts.org/discover",
  "guide_open_preferences_button_title": "打开食品偏好",
  "guide_coming_soon_button_title": "即将推出",
